 leave both the conversation and comments unchanged. Replies **do not send email**.
 
+Staff can combine ticket filters; all supplied filters must match:
+
+```http
+GET /api/v1/tickets?status=open&assignee_id=unassigned&priority=high&q=receipt
+```
